  "notes": "Smooth display and LED wake from hibernation while preserving startup and sleep behavior. Distinguish transient I2C contention from power-test sensor faults, with bounded fresh paired INA monitoring and explicit failure reasons. Add heater and estimated battery NTC temperature to DEV statistics; battery uses the confirmed 10 kOhm nominal and provisional B3940 curve. Physical wake smoothness and a complete local load-test run still require device acceptance.",
